     # lands or none of it does. The manifest importer goes through here so
     # that a rejected manifest leaves the book exactly as it was before the
-    # attempt.
+    # attempt. requires_new forces a real sub-transaction (a savepoint when
+    # one is already open, e.g. inside the nightly bulk importer's own
+    # transaction) so that a rollback here undoes this batch's writes without
+    # disturbing anything around it.
     def as_one_batch(&block)
-      self.class.transaction(&block)
+      self.class.transaction(requires_new: true, &block)
     end
 end
